-asymmetric and flat-symmetric synapses on spines, dendritic trunks, and cell bodies in area 17 of the cat</article-title>.<source>J. Comp. Neurol.</source><volume>231</volume>,<fpage>180</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>189</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/cne.902310206</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3968234</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beierlein</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Connors</surname><given-names>B. W.</given-names></name></person-group>(<year>2002</year>)<article-title>Short-term dynamics of thalamocortical and intracortical synapses onto layer 6 neurons in neocortex</article-title>.<source>J. Neurophysiol.</source><volume>88</volume>,<fpage>1924</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1932</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12364518</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Beierlein</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Gibson</surname><given-names>J. R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Connors</surname><given-names>B. W.</given-names></name></person-group>(<year>2003</year>)<article-title>Two dynamically distinct inhibitory networks in layer 4 of the neocortex</article-title>.<source>J. Neurophysiol.</source><volume>90</volume>,<fpage>2987</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>3000</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1152/jn.00283.2003</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12815025</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Benshalom</surname><given-names>G.</given-names></name><name><surname>White</surname><given-names>E. L.</given-names></name></person-group>(<year>1986</year>)<article-title>Quantification of thalamocortical synapses with spiny stellate neurons in layer IV of mouse somatosensory cortex</article-title>.<source>J. Comp. Neurol.</source><volume>253<